      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects a PCI/USB device inventory signature (count + MD5 of the sorted device list via lspci/lsusb) and reports new or removed devices versus the previous cycle using a local state file. Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype devfleet:status) and devfleet.* metrics (device counts, delta count) to index=metrics (sourcetype devfleet:metrics) hourly, with dashboards.",
